# 选择 HTTP Client 的 local 环境。先运行 auth.http，再运行 admin-schedule.http 的三个创建请求，
# 取得 paidScheduleId、cancelScheduleId、expireScheduleId。每次新的预约意图使用新 UUID；
# 网络重试必须沿用原 Idempotency-Key。

@paidKey = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
@cancelKey = 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222
@rebookKey = 33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333
@expireKey = 44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444444

### 创建就诊人
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "HTTP 示例就诊人",
  "documentType": "RESIDENT_ID_CARD",
  "documentNo": "11010519491231002X",
  "contactPhone": "13800138000",
  "contactEmail": "patient@example.com"
}

> {% client.global.set("patientId", response.body.data.id); %}

### 查询医生排班：列表保留未开放、约满、截止和关闭场次
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/doctors/1/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 路径 A：暂占一个统一库存名额
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{paidKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduleId": "{{paidScheduleId}}",
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}"
}

> {%
client.global.set("paidAppointmentId", response.body.data.appointmentOrderId);
client.global.set("paidPaymentId", response.body.data.paymentOrderId);
%}

### A：模拟网络重试，沿用同键，返回原预约简短回执且不重复扣库存
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{paidKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduleId": "{{paidScheduleId}}",
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}"
}

### A：截止前模拟支付，返回 CONFIRMED + PAID 和 visitNumber
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/{{paidPaymentId}}/simulate-success
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### A：查看就诊序号、快照和停诊字段
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{paidAppointmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### A：开诊前超过 24 小时时取消已确认预约，返回 REFUNDED 和模拟全额退款成功
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{paidAppointmentId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 路径 B：创建待支付预约
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{cancelKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduleId": "{{cancelScheduleId}}",
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}"
}

> {%
client.global.set("cancelAppointmentId", response.body.data.appointmentOrderId);
client.global.set("cancelPaymentId", response.body.data.paymentOrderId);
%}

### B：待支付主动取消，状态为 CANCELLED + CLOSED，暂占转回可用
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{cancelAppointmentId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### B：用新键重新预约同一场，证明有效预约占用已释放
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{rebookKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduleId": "{{cancelScheduleId}}",
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}"
}

### 路径 C：创建预约并等待 paymentExpiresAt
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{expireKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduleId": "{{expireScheduleId}}",
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}"
}

> {%
client.global.set("expiringAppointmentId", response.body.data.appointmentOrderId);
client.global.set("expiringPaymentId", response.body.data.paymentOrderId);
%}

# 到达 paymentExpiresAt 后，支付立即返回 409 / PAYMENT_EXPIRED；
# 默认扫描每 30 秒关闭订单并把暂占名额转回可用。

### C：到期支付被拒绝
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/{{expiringPaymentId}}/simulate-success
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### C：扫描后查看 EXPIRED + CLOSED
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{expiringAppointmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 查询我的全部预约及历史快照
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/my
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
